Vial of Swirling Smoke	29	{"kind":"item","title":"Vial of Swirling Smoke","wikiPath":"/Vial_of_Swirling_Smoke","sources":[{"kind":"vendor","where":"a clockwork alchemist","detail":"Ak'Anon"},{"kind":"vendor","where":"Murtog MacYee","detail":"Halas"},{"kind":"vendor","where":"Jondin","detail":"West Cabilis"},{"kind":"vendor","where":"Sharin Denuen","detail":"Erudin Palace"},{"kind":"vendor","where":"Merchant Yisasan","detail":"Felwithe"},{"kind":"vendor","where":"Shrub Marwood","detail":"Firiona Vie"},{"kind":"vendor","where":"Olyna Mudel","detail":"West Freeport"},{"kind":"vendor","where":"Torlig Mudel","detail":"West Freeport"},{"kind":"vendor","where":"Baldoleky Rockfinder","detail":"South Kaladim"},{"kind":"vendor","where":"Gambel Quick","detail":"Neriak - Foreign Quarter"},{"kind":"vendor","where":"Marza T`Kix","detail":"Neriak Commons"},{"kind":"vendor","where":"Drawna Opimsor","detail":"South Qeynos"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Red Dragonscale Armor Quest"}],"components":[],"rewards":[],"card":{"title":"Vial of Swirling Smoke","icon":"https://eqlwiki.com/images/a/ac/Item_695.png","lines":["MAGIC ITEM LORE ITEM","EXPENDABLE Charges: 1","Effect: Gate (Any Slot, Casting Time: Instant) as Level 10","WT: 0.1 Size: TINY","Class: ALL","Race: ALL"]},"fetchedAt":"2026-10-28T04:22:56.372Z","outOfEra":false}
Blackburrow Stout Quest	29	{"kind":"quest","title":"Blackburrow Stout Quest","wikiPath":"/Blackburrow_Stout_Quest","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Rivervale","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Rueppy Kutpurse","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Experience"},{"text":"Coin"}],"card":{"title":"Blackburrow Stout Quest","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: All","Related Zones: Misty Thicket","Related NPCs: Gunrich"]},"links":["Moonstones","Rivervale","Rueppy Kutpurse","Misty Thicket","Gunrich","Short Beer","Runnyeye","Burtle Barrelbelly","Case of Blackburrow Stout","DeepPockets","Circle Of Unseen Hands","Merchants of Rivervale","Coalition of Tradefolk Underground","Carson McCabe"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Rueppy Kutpurse","text":"Hello. <name>. Rueppy's my name. Why don't you buy us something to [drink] and we can talk?"},{"npc":"Rueppy Kutpurse","text":"How about a short beer? That sounds good."},{"npc":"Rueppy Kutpurse","text":"Oh, thank you. AH! That sure is good. Not as good as [Blackburrow Stout] but what is?"},{"npc":"Rueppy Kutpurse","text":"Blackburrow Stout is a special beer brewed by those dirty gnolls, the Sabertooths. Of course to get it here in Rivervale, you have to [smuggle] it in."},{"npc":"Rueppy Kutpurse","text":"You interested in a little Job? I need you to meet someone who is brining me some stout. He was supposed to meet me in the ruins on the other side of the Great Wall but I have other business to attend to. His name is Gunrich. You might have to wait for a while for him to show up, he will be skittish of a stranger. Payment has already been made. Just tell him. 'Dark rivers flow east,' and he will know you are legit. Make sure you don't say anything else to him or the deal will sour. Meet me back here with the stout."},{"npc":"Gunrich","text":"Heh! Here, here, here. Tell Rueppy hellos from Gunrich. She am so perties. Heh, heh."},{"npc":"Rueppy Kutpurse","text":"Heh heh! You did it! I thought the deputies would get you for sure! I mean..you did it! heh! Here go buy yourself a drink on me."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-28T04:22:57.463Z","outOfEra":false}
Guild Summons - Circle of Unseen Hands	29	{"kind":"quest","title":"Guild Summons - Circle of Unseen Hands","wikiPath":"/Guild_Summons_-_Circle_of_Unseen_Hands","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"North Qeynos","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Hanns Krieghor","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Second Hand Tunic*","item":"Second Hand Tunic*","wikiPath":"/Second_Hand_Tunic*"}],"steps":[{"parts":["Hand Hanns Krieghor your Napkin from Crow's"],"steps":[{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Circle of Unseen Hands"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Merchants of Qeynos"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Corrupt Qeynos Guards"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Guards of Qeynos"}," got worse."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Kane Bayle"}," got better."],"steps":[]}]}],"card":{"title":"Guild Summons - Circle of Unseen Hands","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: Rogue","Related Zones: North Qeynos","Related NPCs: Hanns Krieghor"]},"links":["Guild Summons","North Qeynos","Hanns Krieghor","Rogue","Second Hand Tunic*","Napkin from Crow's","Circle of Unseen Hands","Merchants of Qeynos","Corrupt Qeynos Guards","Guards of Qeynos","Kane Bayle"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Hanns Krieghor","text":"My name is Hanns.. Do as I say. and we shall get along just fine."},{"npc":"Hanns Krieghor","text":"Lucky thing you weren't followed, or you'd be breathing through holes in your back right now. Remember, we keep our business quiet, so watch yourself, sewer crawler."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-28T04:22:58.772Z","outOfEra":false}
Call for Aid	29	{"kind":"quest","title":"Call for Aid","wikiPath":"/Call_for_Aid","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Nikko Canti","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[],"card":{"title":"Call for Aid","lines":["Minimum Level: ?","Classes: ALL","Related Zones: North Freeport, Neriak - Commons, The Temple of Solusek Ro","Related NPCs: Dorian G`Wyn, Sir Mollin, Pishtian F`Lok, Lord Lyfyx of Burwood","Required Faction: Indifferent at all steps"]},"links":["Lake Nerius","Nikko Canti","North Freeport","Neriak - Commons","The Temple of Solusek Ro","Dorian G`Wyn","Sir Mollin","Pishtian F`Lok","Lord Lyfyx of Burwood","Unfortunate news","Plea to Freeport","Appeal of Neriak","Solusek Petition","A Curt Dismissal","Exorbitant Commission","Ordination of Might","What's going on here","Unfortunate News","Something Fishy","Alchemical Solution"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Dorian G`Wyn","text":"Ah, I hoped to avoid endangering you with that knowledge. I am who I claim to be in most regards. I am not, however, a human. I am an Elf. a [Half Dark Elf].` He looks about to ensure no one is watching and unclasps a bracelet he is wearing. As soon as the clasp is undone, Dorian shimmers for the briefest moment and looking at you is a different face, a new face. Clearly elven but cerulean in color, and distinct from the Elves you're familiar with."},{"npc":"Dorian G`Wyn","text":"Don`t be alarmed. It`s the same me.` He quickly snaps his bracelet back on and again Human, he checks to see if anyone was looking. `My people are in hiding. We`ve always been in hiding. The world will not accept us and so we stay hidden. However since the tumult within Castle Nektropos, our safety has been [jeopardized]."},{"npc":"Dorian G`Wyn","text":"Activity within the castle has been different recently. And bizarre: Abnormal visitors, screams echo the halls at all hours, errant magical commotion causing chaos, the smell of death and rot. Our spies on the staff claim there are offal piles inside the castle. They say carts of corpses have been coming into the castle, and that same cart driver left with his cart empty. One claimed he saw some multi-limbed rotting horror shamble past a door way. Something is amiss in Nektropos, and I fear it involves dark magics. Whatever it is, it endangers my people's [hidden home] and something must be done to [alleviate the threat]."},{"npc":"Dorian G`Wyn","text":"I have been working franticly to find a way to end these threats. The tricky part is doing so while still keeping my people's existence hidden from the world that will never accept us. I tried alchemy, but my experiments including the most recent ones keep failing to prove effective. And so I've been quietly searching for the right contacts to petition for aid. With help from the nearby cities, I`m certain we could put an end to the undead and sort out whatever is happening behind the castle`s closed gates. You're involved now, and you would forever be an ally if you can get these requests for aid into the hands of those who may be able to field aid with discretion!"},{"npc":"Pishtian F`Lok","text":"Hmmm, fulfilling this request seems like it would be extremely costly. I'll give you an estimate on mobilizing some forces, but only because our brother has set up shop out that way."},{"npc":"Lord Lyfyx of Burwood","text":"A petition for aid against some unknown evil? We followers of the Burning Prince heed his teachings of self sufficiency and strength. We will send you Solusek's blessing and with it you will surely overcome the obstacle you face. The power to do so will please the Burning Prince and he will smile upon your prowess."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-28T05:18:03.949Z","outOfEra":false}
